## 2. Method, as in zenray-height (12 October 2026)

1. Inventory by measurement: a 0.5 s scan of the whole video (136 frames), a bright-text detector, then for each mark the frame of highest steady contrast inside its hold window (top-hat energy minus change to the neighbours). Three windows were moved after reading the crops (Ultra-crips 14.0 s, Find My 31.2 s, Air-gap 42.4 s, glyphs hidden by a bright background or a hand at the first pick).
2. Reference coverage: background by grey opening, ink colour measured per 60 px bin along the line (the captions brighten along x, measured 2 to 15 percent), coverage by projection on (ink minus background), matting noise floor removed (p97 of far pixels), occluded or low-contrast pixels at weight 0.
3. Family: no free family is the OneKey typeface. Best soft IoU with the marks fitter: Figtree on 11 marks, DM Sans 5, Albert Sans 5, Plus Jakarta Sans 6, Lexend 2 (F3-probe-all2.log). The F1 matcher (no blur, no weights) ranked Figtree first on Four secure elements at 0.849.
4. Fit V_001 per mark with its best family, then two chained rounds of the F1 creator (globals, spacing, per-point offsets, blur carried) and a refit of the built font. Measured gain of the creator: 0.915 to 0.942 soft on Four secure elements, about plus 0.04 to 0.08 on most marks, plateau after the second round.
5. SVG marks: the F2 tracer on the crop.

