Edit a mark without asking: change a value in `motions/onekey-f3-<id>/V_NNN/params.json` through `vary --set` (text, size_px, tracking_em, font.axes, colour, lightmap.gain, blur_px, opacity, origin_px); the SVG gets the same parameters in its metadata and named glyph paths.
